# OpenRC sequential meteorological data
# One row per hourly observation; each row becomes one realization.
#
# Required columns:
#   stability_class   Pasquill-Gifford class A-F
#   wind_speed_m_s    10-m reference wind speed (m/s)
#
# Optional columns (omit column or leave cell blank):
#   wind_dir_deg      Wind direction from north, degrees (reserved: wind-shift)
#   u_star_m_s        Friction velocity (reserved: Monin-Obukhov similarity theory)
#   mixing_height_m   Mixing layer height; overrides the config value for that realization
#
